  "must_fix": [
    "Queue freshness is checked before experiments.submit(), but that function repeats expensive validate() and authorized() calls before Store reservation, then performs further real H1 validation before launching. No queue-age check follows these validations. Reproduced with tools.test_r6_submit_store.bound in a temporary directory: retain real submit/Store, advance the synthetic queue clock by nine seconds inside validate() only after submission_claim exists, and stop releases.freeze before any launch. Result: Store START_INTENT, observation_fresh=false, age_seconds=9.0, process_launch_calls=0. Actual exact baseline validation independently took 11.53 seconds. Enforce freshness at the actual post-validation submission boundary and cover this path without mocking submit. The unchanged AppLauncher gate does not repair this queue admission defect."
  ],
